      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">Top 4 Production Failure Modes & Incident Runbook</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        When operating systems at scale in the Employer of Record & Global Payroll Math vertical, teams frequently encounter silent degradation patterns. Here is the operational runbook for diagnosing and resolving the top 4 critical failure modes:
